<div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Workspace</p><h1>Account settings</h1><p class="muted">Set a local timezone for quota-day cutoffs. Stored timestamps remain UTC.</p></div>
<div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><h2>Daily quota and time zone</h2><div class="notice notice-info">Your account has a limit of <strong><?= number_format((int)$user['daily_limit']) ?> outbound message parts per calendar day</strong>. One recipient × one ordered part = one part. Quota is reserved transactionally when your campaign is confirmed.</div>
<form method="post" action="<?= e(url('profile')) ?>" class="stack"><?= csrf_field() ?><label for="timezone">Your timezone</label><select name="timezone" id="timezone"><?php foreach(timezone_identifiers_list() as $tz): ?><option value="<?= e($tz) ?>" <?= ($user['timezone']??'UTC')===$tz?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($tz) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><p class="hint">New access codes expire at the end of your configured local calendar day. Existing reservations are stored against their UTC quota date.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Save settings</button></form></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Change password</h2><form method="post" action="<?= e(url('profile/password')) ?>" class="stack"><?= csrf_field() ?><label for="current-password">Current password</label><input id="current-password" name="current_password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><label for="new-password">New password</label><input id="new-password" name="new_password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required><p class="hint">At least 12 characters. You will be signed out after this change.</p><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Update password</button></form></section></div>
